§§ `Blank nested records -- Chapters 6 to 15`
`blank state offence` MEANS `State Offence` WITH
    `wages war against the Government or attempts to wage such war or abets the waging of such war` IS FALSE
    `plans the death of or hurt to or unlawful imprisonment or restraint of the President` IS FALSE
    `plans the unlawful deprivation or deposition of the President from the sovereignty of Singapore or the overawing by criminal force of the Government` IS FALSE
    `abets the commission of an offence punishable by section 121A or 121B` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe that an offence punishable under section 121 121A 121B or 121C has been committed` IS FALSE
    `intentionally omits to give information respecting that offence which he is legally bound to give` IS FALSE
    `collects men arms or ammunition or otherwise prepares to wage war` IS FALSE
    `intends either to wage or to be prepared to wage war against the Government` IS FALSE
    `by any act or illegal omission conceals the existence of a design to wage war against the Government` IS FALSE
    `intends by the concealment to facilitate or knows it to be likely that the concealment will facilitate the waging of such war` IS FALSE
    `intends to induce or compel the President or a Member of Parliament or the Cabinet to exercise or refrain from exercising in any manner any of the lawful powers of the President or such Member` IS FALSE
    `assaults or wrongfully restrains or attempts wrongfully to restrain or overawes by criminal force or the show of criminal force or attempts so to overawe the President or such Member` IS FALSE
    `wages war against the government of a power in alliance or at peace with the Government or attempts to wage such war or abets the waging of such war` IS FALSE
    `commits depredation or makes preparations to commit depredation on the territories of a power in alliance or at peace with the Government` IS FALSE
    `receives property knowing it to have been taken in the commission of an offence mentioned in section 125 or 126` IS FALSE
    `is a public servant having the custody of a prisoner of State or prisoner of war` IS FALSE
    `voluntarily allows the prisoner to escape from the place in which the prisoner is confined` IS FALSE
    `negligently suffers the prisoner to escape from the place of confinement in which the prisoner is confined` IS FALSE
    `knowingly aids or assists a prisoner of State or prisoner of war in escaping from lawful custody or rescues or attempts to rescue such a prisoner` IS FALSE
    `harbours or conceals a prisoner of State or prisoner of war` IS FALSE
    `the prisoner has escaped from lawful custody` IS FALSE
