    `the act or omission causes the death of any other person` IS FALSE
`blank obscenity` MEANS Obscenity WITH
    `the object is an obscene book pamphlet paper drawing painting representation or figure or any other obscene object including data stored electronically that is capable of conversion to images writing or any other form of representation` IS FALSE
    `the sale letting to hire distribution exhibition circulation import export conveyance of or other dealing in the object is authorised by or under written law` IS FALSE
    `the object is a book pamphlet writing drawing or painting kept or used bona fide for religious purposes or a representation on or in a temple or on a car used for the conveyance of idols or kept or used for a religious purpose` IS FALSE
    `sells lets to hire distributes publicly exhibits or puts into circulation the obscene object by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `makes produces or has in his possession the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `imports exports or conveys the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or knowing or having reason to believe that it will be sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `takes part in or receives profits from a business in the course of which he knows or has reason to believe that an obscene object is made produced purchased kept imported exported or conveyed for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or is sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `advertises or makes known by any means whatsoever that any person is engaged or is ready to engage in an act which is an offence under section 292 or that an obscene object can be procured from or through any person` IS FALSE
    `offers or attempts to do an act which is an offence under section 292` IS FALSE
