§§ `Kidnapping fixtures -- Chapter 16, sections 359 to 374`

-- s 361: a minor below 16 taken out of the keeping of the lawful guardian without consent.
`a child taken from its guardian` MEANS Kidnapping WITH
    `conveys any person beyond the limits of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `without the consent of that person or of some person legally authorised to consent on behalf of that person` IS FALSE
