§§ `Sexual penetration fixtures -- Chapter 16, sections 375 to 377B`

-- s 375(1)(a): penile penetration of the vagina of a woman without her consent.
`penile penetration without consent` MEANS `Sexual Penetration` WITH
    `a man penetrates with his penis the vagina of a woman` IS TRUE
    `a man penetrates with his penis the anus or mouth of another person` IS FALSE
    `sexually penetrates with a part of the body other than the penis if a man or anything else the vagina or anus of another person` IS FALSE
    `causes a man to penetrate with his penis the vagina anus or mouth of another person including the accused` IS FALSE
    `causes another person to sexually penetrate with a part of that person body other than the penis if a man or anything else the vagina or anus of any person` IS FALSE
    `the other person did not consent to the penetration` IS TRUE
    `the other person is below 14 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the other person is below 16 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the other person is of or above 16 but below 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the accused is in a relationship that is exploitative of the other person` IS FALSE
    `in order to commit or to facilitate the commission of the offence voluntarily causes hurt to any person` IS FALSE
    `in order to commit or to facilitate the commission of the offence puts a person in fear of death or hurt to that person or any other person` IS FALSE
    `the accused proves that by reason of mistake of fact in good faith he believed that the act of penetration was done with consent` IS FALSE
    `the act would constitute an offence under section 375 or 376` IS FALSE
    `the act would constitute an offence under section 375(1)(a) 375(1A)(a) 376(2) or 376AA(1)` IS FALSE
    `obtains for consideration the sexual services of a person below 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `communicates with another person for the purpose of obtaining for consideration the sexual services of a person below 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the accused is a citizen or a permanent resident of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `does outside Singapore an act that would if done in Singapore constitute an offence under section 376B` IS FALSE
    `does in Singapore an act involving a person below 18 years of age who is outside Singapore that would if that person were in Singapore constitute an offence under section 376B` IS FALSE
    `does outside Singapore an act involving a person below 18 years of age who is in Singapore that would if done in Singapore constitute an offence under section 376B` IS FALSE
    `makes or organises travel arrangements for another person intending to facilitate the commission by that person of an offence under section 376C` IS FALSE
    `transports another person to a place outside Singapore intending to facilitate the commission by that person of an offence under section 376C` IS FALSE
    `prints publishes or distributes information intended to promote conduct that would constitute an offence under section 376C or to assist another to engage in such conduct` IS FALSE
    `the accused is of or above 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the accused had met or communicated with the other person on at least one previous occasion` IS FALSE
    `one of the five meeting or travelling acts in section 376E(1)(a) takes place` IS FALSE
    `at the time of that act the accused intends during or after the meeting to do anything to or in respect of the other person which would involve the commission by the accused of a relevant offence` IS FALSE
    `the accused does not reasonably believe that the other person is of or above 16 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the accused does not reasonably believe that the other person is of or above 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `for the purpose of obtaining sexual gratification or of causing the other person humiliation alarm or distress the accused intentionally communicated with that person` IS FALSE
    `the communication is sexual` IS FALSE
    `for the purpose of obtaining sexual gratification or of causing the other person humiliation alarm or distress the accused intentionally engages in an activity` IS FALSE
    `the activity is sexual` IS FALSE
    `the accused engages in the activity when the other person is present or is in a place from which the accused can be observed` IS FALSE
    `either the accused or the other person or both are in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the accused knows or believes that the other person is aware or intends that the other person should be aware that the accused is engaging in it` IS FALSE
    `for the purpose of obtaining sexual gratification or of causing the other person humiliation alarm or distress the accused intentionally causes that person to observe an image` IS FALSE
    `the image is sexual` IS FALSE
    `the accused intentionally touches another person or intentionally incites that person to touch the accused that person or another person` IS FALSE
    `the touching is sexual and the other person consents to the touching` IS FALSE
    `the accused obtains that consent by means of an inducement offered or given a threat made or a deception practised for that purpose` IS FALSE
    `the accused obtains that consent where the other person is the accused spouse by means of a threat made or a deception practised for that purpose` IS FALSE
    `the other person has a mental disability` IS FALSE
    `the accused knows or could reasonably be expected to know that the other person has a mental disability` IS FALSE
    `the accused is of or above 16 years of age` IS FALSE
    `the other person is of or above 16 years of age and is a close family relative being a grandchild child sibling half-sibling parent or grandparent whether or not traced through lawful wedlock` IS FALSE
    `causes or permits a close family relative to penetrate or sexually penetrate the accused` IS FALSE
    `the accused knows that the other person is a close family relative` IS FALSE
    `the accused is a person below 18 years of age who is a victim of an offence under section 376AA in respect of the same acts` IS FALSE
    `the accused fraudulently obtains the other person consent by means of a deception or false representation practised or made for that purpose` IS FALSE
    `the deception or false representation relates to the use or manner of use of any sexually protective measure` IS FALSE
    `the deception or false representation relates to the risk of the other person contracting a sexually transmitted disease from the touching` IS FALSE
    `the accused knows or has reason to believe that the consent was given in consequence of such deception or false representation` IS FALSE
    `penetrates or sexually penetrates a human corpse or causes the accused own body to be so penetrated by a human corpse` IS FALSE
    `causes another person to penetrate or sexually penetrate a human corpse or causes that person body to be so penetrated by a human corpse` IS FALSE
    `that other person did not consent to the penetration` IS FALSE
    `penetrates with the accused penis the vagina anus or any orifice of an animal or causes or permits the accused vagina anus or mouth to be penetrated by the penis of an animal` IS FALSE
    `causes a man to penetrate with his penis the vagina anus or any orifice of an animal or causes the vagina anus or mouth of another person to be penetrated with the penis of an animal` IS FALSE

-- s 375(5): despite s 79, a mistake of fact in good faith as to consent is a defence to the non-consent limb.
`penile penetration with a good-faith belief in consent` MEANS `Sexual Penetration` WITH
    `a man penetrates with his penis the vagina of a woman` IS TRUE
    `a man penetrates with his penis the anus or mouth of another person` IS FALSE
    `sexually penetrates with a part of the body other than the penis if a man or anything else the vagina or anus of another person` IS FALSE
    `causes a man to penetrate with his penis the vagina anus or mouth of another person including the accused` IS FALSE
