`setting fire to a dwelling` MEANS Mischief WITH
    `with intent to cause or knowing that he is likely to cause wrongful loss or damage to the public or any person` IS TRUE
    `causes the destruction of any property or such change in any property or in the situation of it as destroys or diminishes its value or utility or affects it injuriously` IS TRUE
