    `the act intended to be induced is one the person has an enforceable duty to do or the omission intended to be induced is of an act the person is not entitled to do` IS FALSE
    `counterfeits upon or in the substance of any material any device or mark used for the purpose of authenticating a document or electronic record` IS FALSE
    `has in his possession any material upon or in the substance of which any such device or mark has been counterfeited` IS FALSE
    `intends that the device or mark shall be used for the purpose of giving the appearance of authenticity to any document or electronic record then forged or thereafter to be forged on that material` IS FALSE
    `the device or mark is used for the purpose of authenticating a document described in section 467` IS FALSE
    `cancels destroys or defaces or attempts to cancel destroy or deface or secretes or attempts to secrete a document or commits mischief in respect of it` IS FALSE
    `the document is or purports to be a will or an authority to adopt a child or any valuable security` IS FALSE
    `with intent to cause damage or injury to the public or to any person` IS FALSE
    `is a clerk officer or servant or is employed or acting in the capacity of a clerk officer or servant` IS FALSE
    `intentionally and with intent to defraud destroys alters conceals mutilates or falsifies any book electronic record paper writing valuable security or account or a set of them which belongs to or is in the possession of his employer or has been received by him for or on behalf of his employer` IS FALSE
    `intentionally and with intent to defraud makes or abets the making of any false entry in or omits or alters or abets the omission or alteration of any material particular from or in any such book electronic record paper writing valuable security or account or set of them` IS TRUE

§§ `Chapter 18 fixtures -- currency and bank notes`

-- s 489A: forging currency notes.
`printing counterfeit notes` MEANS Currency WITH
    `the thing is a bank note being a promissory note or engagement for the payment of money to bearer on demand issued by a person carrying on the business of banking in any part of the world or issued by or under the authority of the government of any country or territory and intended to be used as equivalent to or as a substitute for money` IS FALSE
    `the thing is currency including a currency note or coin which is legal tender in the country or territory in which it is issued` IS TRUE
    `the thing is a coin being metal used as money stamped and issued by or under the authority of the government of any country or territory in order to be so used` IS FALSE
    `forges or counterfeits or knowingly performs any part of the process of forging or counterfeiting the currency or bank note` IS TRUE
    `the currency or bank note is forged or counterfeit` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe the currency or bank note to be forged or counterfeit` IS FALSE
    `delivers or sells to or buys or receives from any other person or otherwise imports exports or traffics in or uses as genuine the currency or bank note` IS FALSE
    `has the currency or bank note in his possession` IS FALSE
    `intends to use the currency or bank note as genuine or that it may be used as genuine` IS FALSE
    `makes mends or performs any part of the process of making or mending or buys sells or disposes of or has in his possession any die machinery instrument or material` IS FALSE
    `the die machinery instrument or material is for the purpose of being used or he knows or has reason to believe that it is intended to be used for forging or counterfeiting any currency or bank note` IS FALSE
    `the accused is within Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the thing abetted is the counterfeiting of currency out of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `performs on the coin an operation which diminishes its weight or alters its composition` IS FALSE
    `performs on the currency an operation which alters its appearance` IS FALSE
    `intends that the currency will pass as currency of a different description` IS FALSE
    `delivers to any other person as genuine or as currency of a different description from what it is or attempts to induce any person to receive as genuine or as currency of a different description the currency` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe that an operation mentioned in section 489F or 489G has been performed on the currency` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe that an offence under section 489F or 489G has been committed with respect to the currency` IS FALSE

