    `does an act that by the law of nations is piracy` IS TRUE
    `while committing or attempting to commit piracy murders or attempts to murder another person or does an act likely to endanger the life of another person` IS TRUE
    `steals a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `steals or without lawful authority throws overboard damages or destroys anything that is part of the cargo supplies or fittings in a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `does or attempts to do a mutinous act on a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `counsels or procures a person to do any of those things` IS FALSE
