-- s 130C(d).
`inciting a mutiny on a Singapore ship` MEANS Piracy WITH
    `does an act that by the law of nations is piracy` IS FALSE
    `while committing or attempting to commit piracy murders or attempts to murder another person or does an act likely to endanger the life of another person` IS FALSE
    `steals a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `steals or without lawful authority throws overboard damages or destroys anything that is part of the cargo supplies or fittings in a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `does or attempts to do a mutinous act on a Singapore ship` IS FALSE
    `counsels or procures a person to do any of those things` IS TRUE
-- s 130D(a): the capital case.
`killing members of a group to destroy it` MEANS Genocide WITH
    `intends to destroy in whole or in part a national ethnical racial or religious group` IS TRUE
    `kills members of the group` IS TRUE
    `causes serious bodily or mental harm to members of the group` IS FALSE
    `deliberately inflicts on the group conditions of life calculated to bring about its physical destruction in whole or in part` IS FALSE
    `imposes measures intended to prevent births within the group` IS FALSE
    `forcibly transfers children of the group to another group` IS FALSE
-- s 130D(d).
`preventing births in a group to destroy it` MEANS Genocide WITH
    `intends to destroy in whole or in part a national ethnical racial or religious group` IS TRUE
    `kills members of the group` IS FALSE
    `causes serious bodily or mental harm to members of the group` IS FALSE
    `deliberately inflicts on the group conditions of life calculated to bring about its physical destruction in whole or in part` IS FALSE
    `imposes measures intended to prevent births within the group` IS TRUE
    `forcibly transfers children of the group to another group` IS FALSE
-- s 130D needs the intent to destroy the group.
`preventing births without the intent to destroy` MEANS Genocide WITH
    `intends to destroy in whole or in part a national ethnical racial or religious group` IS FALSE
    `kills members of the group` IS FALSE
    `causes serious bodily or mental harm to members of the group` IS FALSE
    `deliberately inflicts on the group conditions of life calculated to bring about its physical destruction in whole or in part` IS FALSE
    `imposes measures intended to prevent births within the group` IS TRUE
    `forcibly transfers children of the group to another group` IS FALSE
§§ `Chapter 7 fixtures -- offences relating to the armed forces`
-- s 131: abetting mutiny; no mutiny follows.
`urging a soldier to mutiny` MEANS `Armed Forces Offence` WITH
    `the person concerned is an officer or serviceman in the Singapore Armed Forces or any visiting forces lawfully present in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the person concerned is a member of the Singapore Police Force or of a volunteer auxiliary or special force attached to or under the jurisdiction of that Force` IS FALSE
    `abets the committing of mutiny by the officer or serviceman` IS TRUE
    `attempts to seduce the officer or serviceman from his allegiance or his duty` IS FALSE
    `mutiny is committed in consequence of the abetment` IS FALSE
    `abets an assault by the officer or serviceman on a superior officer being in the execution of his office` IS FALSE
    `the assault is committed in consequence of the abetment` IS FALSE
    `abets the desertion of the officer or serviceman` IS FALSE
    `knows or has reason to believe that the officer or serviceman has deserted` IS FALSE
    `harbours the officer or serviceman` IS FALSE
    `intends to prevent the officer or serviceman from being apprehended` IS FALSE
    `is the master or person in charge of a merchant vessel on board which a deserter from the forces is concealed` IS FALSE
    `might have known of the concealment but for some neglect of his duty as master or person in charge or but for some want of discipline on board the vessel` IS FALSE
    `abets what he knows to be an act of insubordination by the officer or serviceman` IS FALSE
    `the act of insubordination is committed in consequence of the abetment` IS FALSE
    `provision is made in a law relating to the discipline of the Singapore Armed Forces for the punishment of a corresponding offence and the person is subject to that provision` IS FALSE
    `is not a serviceman in the Singapore Armed Forces or any visiting forces lawfully present in Singapore` IS FALSE
    `wears any garb or carries any token resembling any garb or token used by such a serviceman` IS FALSE
    `intends that it may be believed that he is such a serviceman` IS FALSE
    `supplies the person with shelter food drink money clothes arms ammunition or means of conveyance or assists the person in any way to evade apprehension` IS FALSE
