    `intentionally prevents the lawful affixing to any place of such a summons notice or order or intentionally removes it from a place to which it is lawfully affixed` IS FALSE
    `intentionally prevents the lawful making of a proclamation under the authority of a public servant legally competent as such to direct it` IS FALSE
