    `intentionally omits to attend at that place or time or departs from the place before the time at which it is lawful to depart` IS FALSE
    `is legally bound to produce or deliver up a document or electronic record to a public servant as such` IS FALSE
    `intentionally omits to produce or deliver up the document or electronic record` IS FALSE
    `is legally bound to give a notice or to furnish information on any subject to a public servant as such` IS FALSE
    `intentionally omits to give the notice or furnish the information in the manner and at the time required by law` IS FALSE
    `is legally bound to furnish information on any subject to a public servant as such` IS FALSE
    `furnishes as true information on the subject which he knows or has reason to believe to be false` IS FALSE
    `the notice or information respects the commission of an offence or is required to prevent the commission of an offence or in order to the apprehension of an offender` IS FALSE
    `refuses to bind himself by an oath to state the truth when required so to bind himself by a public servant legally competent to require it` IS FALSE
    `is legally bound to state the truth on any subject to a public servant` IS FALSE
    `refuses to answer a question demanded of him touching that subject by that public servant in the exercise of his legal powers` IS FALSE
    `refuses to sign a statement made by him when required to sign it by a public servant legally competent to require it` IS FALSE
    `is legally bound by an oath to state the truth on any subject to a public servant or other person authorised by law to administer such oaths` IS FALSE
