    `the act or omission causes common injury danger or annoyance to the public or to the people in general who dwell or occupy property in the vicinity` IS FALSE
    `the act or omission must necessarily cause injury obstruction danger or annoyance to persons who may have occasion to use a public right` IS FALSE
    `transmits or communicates or causes to be transmitted or communicated information which contains a reference to the presence in any place or location or in any conveyance or means of transportation of a thing that is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS FALSE
    `knows that the reference is false or fabricated` IS FALSE
    `places a thing in any place or location or in any conveyance or means of transportation or sends a thing from one place to another by post courier or any other means` IS TRUE
    `has a reasonable excuse` IS TRUE
    `intends to induce in one or more other persons a belief that the thing is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS TRUE
    `places or sends the thing intentionally` IS FALSE
    `knows that there is a real risk that one or more persons would believe that the thing is likely to cause hurt or damage to property by any means` IS FALSE
    `the public nuisance is otherwise punishable by this Code` IS FALSE
    `knew that the act or omission constituting the public nuisance will cause or will probably cause common injury danger or annoyance to the public or to the people in general who dwell or occupy property in the vicinity` IS FALSE
    `this is a second or subsequent conviction` IS FALSE
    `repeats or continues a public nuisance` IS FALSE
    `has been enjoined by a public servant with lawful authority to issue such an injunction not to repeat or continue the nuisance` IS FALSE
