    `the act or omission endangers human life` IS FALSE
    `the act or omission is likely to cause grievous hurt` IS FALSE
    `the fire causes damage to or diminishes the value or utility of property belonging to any other person or the Government` IS FALSE
    `the act or omission causes hurt or injury to any other person` IS FALSE
    `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person` IS TRUE
    `the act or omission causes the death of any other person` IS FALSE
§§ `Chapter 14 fixtures -- obscenity`
-- s 292(1)(a).
`selling obscene magazines` MEANS Obscenity WITH
    `the object is an obscene book pamphlet paper drawing painting representation or figure or any other obscene object including data stored electronically that is capable of conversion to images writing or any other form of representation` IS TRUE
    `the sale letting to hire distribution exhibition circulation import export conveyance of or other dealing in the object is authorised by or under written law` IS FALSE
    `the object is a book pamphlet writing drawing or painting kept or used bona fide for religious purposes or a representation on or in a temple or on a car used for the conveyance of idols or kept or used for a religious purpose` IS FALSE
    `sells lets to hire distributes publicly exhibits or puts into circulation the obscene object by any means electronic or otherwise` IS TRUE
    `makes produces or has in his possession the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `imports exports or conveys the obscene object for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or knowing or having reason to believe that it will be sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `takes part in or receives profits from a business in the course of which he knows or has reason to believe that an obscene object is made produced purchased kept imported exported or conveyed for the purposes of sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation or is sold let to hire distributed publicly exhibited or put into circulation by any means electronic or otherwise` IS FALSE
    `advertises or makes known by any means whatsoever that any person is engaged or is ready to engage in an act which is an offence under section 292 or that an obscene object can be procured from or through any person` IS FALSE
    `offers or attempts to do an act which is an offence under section 292` IS FALSE
    `the dealing is by electronic means to 10 or more individuals` IS FALSE
    `the obscene object depicts an image of a person who is or who appears to a reasonable observer to be or is implied to be below 18 years of age` IS FALSE
    `on 2 or more occasions sells lets to hire distributes publicly exhibits or puts into circulation by electronic means an obscene object to a total number of 10 or more individuals` IS FALSE
    `imports exports conveys sells lets to hire distributes puts into circulation makes produces or is in possession of an anatomically correct doll mannequin or robot with the features of or with features that appear to a reasonable observer to resemble a person below 16 years of age and intended for use in sexual activities` IS FALSE
    `an obscene object is sold let for hire distributed publicly exhibited or circulated to 10 or more individuals on an online location being an internet domain website webpage chatroom channel group forum or other location accessible by means of the Internet` IS FALSE
    `develops and maintains the online location or organises manages or supervises its use or manages or regulates membership of or access to it or has the authority to decide whether material may be included or excluded on it or where to place material or otherwise exercises editorial control over it` IS FALSE
    `in doing so intends that the online location be used to enable or facilitate the sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation of obscene objects generally` IS FALSE
    `sells lets to hire distributes exhibits or circulates the obscene object to a person below 21 years of age or offers or attempts to do so` IS FALSE
    `to the annoyance of others does an obscene act in a public place or sings recites or utters obscene words in or near a public place` IS FALSE
