    `develops and maintains the online location or organises manages or supervises its use or manages or regulates membership of or access to it or has the authority to decide whether material may be included or excluded on it or where to place material or otherwise exercises editorial control over it` IS FALSE
    `in doing so intends that the online location be used to enable or facilitate the sale hire distribution public exhibition or circulation of obscene objects generally` IS FALSE
    `sells lets to hire distributes exhibits or circulates the obscene object to a person below 21 years of age or offers or attempts to do so` IS FALSE
    `to the annoyance of others does an obscene act in a public place or sings recites or utters obscene words in or near a public place` IS TRUE
§§ `Chapter 15 fixtures -- offences relating to race`
-- s 298.
`a racial slur shouted at a passer-by` MEANS `Racial Offence` WITH
    `with the deliberate intention of wounding the racial feelings of a person utters any word or makes any sound in the hearing of that person or makes any gesture or places any object in the sight of that person or causes any matter however represented to be seen or heard by that person` IS TRUE
    `by words spoken or written or by signs or by visible representations or otherwise knowingly promotes or attempts to promote on grounds of race disharmony or feelings of enmity hatred or ill will between different racial groups` IS FALSE
    `commits an act which he knows is prejudicial to the maintenance of harmony between different racial groups and which disturbs or is likely to disturb the public tranquility` IS FALSE
-- s 298A(a).
`a pamphlet stirring hatred between races` MEANS `Racial Offence` WITH
    `with the deliberate intention of wounding the racial feelings of a person utters any word or makes any sound in the hearing of that person or makes any gesture or places any object in the sight of that person or causes any matter however represented to be seen or heard by that person` IS FALSE
    `by words spoken or written or by signs or by visible representations or otherwise knowingly promotes or attempts to promote on grounds of race disharmony or feelings of enmity hatred or ill will between different racial groups` IS TRUE
    `commits an act which he knows is prejudicial to the maintenance of harmony between different racial groups and which disturbs or is likely to disturb the public tranquility` IS FALSE
-- s 298A(b).
`an act known to threaten racial harmony` MEANS `Racial Offence` WITH
    `with the deliberate intention of wounding the racial feelings of a person utters any word or makes any sound in the hearing of that person or makes any gesture or places any object in the sight of that person or causes any matter however represented to be seen or heard by that person` IS FALSE
    `by words spoken or written or by signs or by visible representations or otherwise knowingly promotes or attempts to promote on grounds of race disharmony or feelings of enmity hatred or ill will between different racial groups` IS FALSE
    `commits an act which he knows is prejudicial to the maintenance of harmony between different racial groups and which disturbs or is likely to disturb the public tranquility` IS TRUE
§§ `Chapter 21 and 22 fixtures -- sections 501, 502 and 507`
-- s 501.
`a printer running off a libel` MEANS Speech WITH
    `makes or publishes an imputation concerning any person` IS FALSE
    `by words spoken or intended to be read or by signs or visible representations` IS FALSE
    `intends to harm or knows or has reason to believe the imputation will harm that person reputation` IS FALSE
    `the imputation would lower that person moral or intellectual character in the estimation of others` IS FALSE
    `the imputation would lower that person character in respect of his calling in the estimation of others` IS FALSE
    `the imputation would lower that person credit in the estimation of others` IS FALSE
    `the imputation would cause it to be believed that the body of that person is in a loathsome or generally disgraceful state` IS FALSE
    `a section 499 exception applies` IS FALSE
    `threatens another with injury to person reputation or property` IS FALSE
    `or to the person or reputation of anyone in whom that person is interested` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause alarm` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause that person to do an act the person is not legally bound to do` IS FALSE
    `intent to cause that person to omit an act the person is legally entitled to do` IS FALSE
    `the intent is that the act or omission be the means of avoiding the execution of the threat` IS FALSE
    `the threat is to cause death or grievous hurt or destruction of property by fire` IS FALSE
    `intentionally insults and thereby gives provocation` IS FALSE
    `intending or knowing it likely the provocation will cause a breach of the public peace or any other offence` IS FALSE
    `makes publishes or circulates a statement rumour or report` IS FALSE
    `in written electronic or other media` IS FALSE
    `intent or likely to cause an officer or serviceman of the Singapore Armed Forces a visiting force or a section 140B person to mutiny or to disregard or fail in his duty` IS FALSE
    `intent or likely to cause fear or alarm to the public whereby a person may be induced to commit an offence against the State or public tranquillity` IS FALSE
    `intent or likely to incite any class or community to commit an offence against any other class or community` IS FALSE
    `has reasonable grounds for believing the statement is true and without the intents above` IS FALSE
    `prints or engraves any matter knowing or having good reason to believe that it is defamatory of any person` IS TRUE
    `sells or offers for sale any printed or engraved substance containing defamatory matter knowing that it contains such matter` IS FALSE
    `the threat is made by an anonymous communication or by a person who has taken precautions to conceal his name or abode` IS FALSE
