#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes continuing in an unlawful assembly after a command to disperse` `staying in a rowdy but lawful crowd after the order to disperse`)
#ASSERT `constitutes obstructing a public servant suppressing a riot` `shoving a police officer breaking up a riot`
#ASSERT `constitutes provocation with intent to cause a riot` `burning an effigy to start a riot`
#ASSERT `constitutes an owner or occupier failing to notify prevent or suppress an unlawful assembly or riot` `a landowner who does nothing about a riot on his land`
#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes an owner or occupier failing to notify prevent or suppress an unlawful assembly or riot` `a landowner who calls the police about a riot on his land`)
#ASSERT `constitutes a beneficiary of a riot failing to prevent or suppress it` `a beneficiary who lets a riot happen for him`
