#ASSERT NOT (`constitutes a beneficiary of a riot failing to prevent or suppress it` `a beneficiary who tried to stop the riot`)
#ASSERT `constitutes harbouring persons hired for an unlawful assembly` `housing hired rioters`
#ASSERT `constitutes being hired for an unlawful assembly` `taking money to join a riot`
#ASSERT (`the punishment for membership of an unlawful assembly`)'s `maximum imprisonment in years` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT (`the punishment for rioting`)'s `caning is available`
